  "retry": "Rerun from immutable source pointers; no external requests or partial retry side effects occur.",
  "checkpoint": "Inputs and outputs are checksummed; publication uses a run-scoped staging directory and atomic current pointer.",
  "idempotency": "Entity IDs derive from source candidates and assertion/relationship IDs are deterministic hashes of source-backed facts.",
  "cancellation": "Stop streaming at the current record; no current pointer is changed until the complete release is published.",
  "source_policy": "Inherited per assertion and coverage field from each contributing source policy; Alaska, California ABC, DC, and Washington L&I record-level outputs stay local-review-only, Alaska aggregates require terms review, Washington L&I aggregates require PDDL attribution and semantic limitations, California ABC aggregates require attribution and semantic limitations, DC aggregates require CC BY 4.0 attribution and semantic limitations, and USPS-derived ZIP coverage inherits the local-restricted or permission-governed USPS policy.",
  "retention_profile": "Retain immutable releases under the most restrictive contributing artifact policy; Alaska, California ABC, DC, and Washington L&I record-level data remain local-review-only, Alaska-derived aggregates require terms review, Washington L&I aggregates require PDDL attribution and semantic limitations, California ABC aggregates require attribution and semantic limitations, DC aggregates require CC BY 4.0 attribution and semantic limitations, and USPS-derived ZIP coverage remains local restricted unless reviewed written permission authorizes another treatment.",
